  "description": "Yuri lived an ordinary life with his parents and grandfather until a blinding light reset the world. Everyone returned to the physical age of nineteen, death vanished, and society collapsed overnight. In the chaos, Yuri’s grandfather disappeared without a trace. As violence becomes consequence-free and justice turns personal, Yuri enters Chicken Blood, a lawless battleground where revenge and secrets collide. In a world where no one can die, Yuri risks everything to uncover what happened to the only person he cannot afford to lose. \n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
